 <h3><u>Pardesi musafir ki</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Pardesi musafir ki</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <font size=4> <p>Halminasir yansuruna x 4</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>(Kuch sehme huye bache) x2</p> <p>Behta huwa pani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>Ay karbobala tere,</p> <p>Daman mein chupa kya kya,</p> <p>(Bachpan ali asger ka) x2</p> <p>akber ki jawaani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>taabut, alam, jula,</p> <p>pani ki sabile bhi,</p> <p>(jis simt nazar jaaye) x2</p> <p>pyaaso ki nishani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>mansoob alam se jo,</p> <p>ek mashke sakina hai,</p> <p>(amu se bhatiji ki) x2</p> <p>ulfat ki nishaani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>ansoo na ruke logo,</p> <p>shabbir ki majlis mein,</p> <p>(us ujre huye gar ki) x2</p> <p>yu yaad manaani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>shabbir ye kehte the,</p> <p>mein kaise ijazat du,</p> <p>(ay qasim tu mere) x2</p> <p>bhayi ki nishaani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>ye laashaye akber par,</p> <p>layla ne kahan ro kar,</p> <p>(kyu khoon me tar teri) x2</p> <p>poshak shahani hai </p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>de te the sadaa sarwar,</p> <p>abbas chale aawo,</p> <p>(mayat ali akber ki) x2</p> <p>ab mujko uthani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>rota hai falak ab tak,</p> <p>shabbir tere gham mein,</p> <p>(dunya ye samaj ti hai) x2</p> <p>barsaat ka paani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>sheh bole bahan zainab,</p> <p>zindaa se riha ho kar,</p> <p>(rudaade sitam jaakar) x2</p> <p>amma ka sunani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>ey mere khuda tujse,</p> <p>har waqt duwa ye hai,</p> <p>(maula ki safay matam) x2</p> <p>har gar mein bichani hai</p> <p>(Pardesi musafir ki purdard kahani hai) x2</p> <p>(Kuch sehme huye bache) x2</p> <p>Behta huwa pani hai</p> <p>&nbsp;</p></font>
